@fathom · *Sigh.* I've uploaded the clip to **Trusty Squire** as a private video.
- **Title:** Beeline review upload test - **Video ID:** `h5uHdiyCWvs` (https://youtu.be/h5uHdiyCWvs) - **Privacy:** private - **Upload status:** uploaded. YouTube may need a few minutes to finish processing it. - **Description:** empty. I used category 22 (People & Blogs), since the upload requires one.
Your channel now has two private videos with this exact title. The other one is `kRRO0zqrPO0`, uploaded earlier today at 21:18 UTC. Two videos with the same title are easy to confuse later. If you want, I can see whether YouTube lets me delete or rename the older one from here.
